# Top-down mock-up: a town street at night. Brick villas and closed shops
# on the north side (two storeys of wall face), the convenience store still
# lit, a crosswalk, a parked car, an alley to the south. Zombies on the road;
# the protagonist hides behind the car.
@palette ../palette/night-school.pal
@size 512 288
@output ../mockups/map_village_td.png
@preview ../previews/map_village_td_x2.png 2
@fill D

@tiles td tiles_topdown.pix
@tiles tw tiles_topdown_walltop.pix
@tiles ns tiles_night_school.pix
@tiles cl tiles_classroom.pix
@tiles rr tiles_restroom.pix
@tiles pr tiles_props.pix
@tiles tn tiles_town_td.pix
@tiles of tiles_office_td.pix
@legend A tw:walltop_15
@legend B tn:brick_upper
@legend C tn:brick_lower
@legend D tn:sidewalk
@legend E tn:curb_s
@legend F tn:road
@legend G tn:road_lane_h
@legend H tn:curb_n
@legend I tw:walltop_14
@legend J tw:walltop_12
